## 5. Provider Router 구현

### `src/providers/provider-router.ts`

```ts
import { Provider } from './provider.interface';
import { NotificationRequest } from '../types/notification';

export class ProviderRouter {
  constructor(private readonly providers: Provider[]) {}

  getProvider(request: NotificationRequest): Provider {
    const provider = this.providers.find((p) => p.supports(request.channel));

    if (!provider) {
      throw new Error(`No provider found for channel: ${request.channel}`);
    }

    return provider;
  }

  async route(request: NotificationRequest) {
    const provider = this.getProvider(request);
    return provider.send(request);
  }
}
```

이 router는 가장 단순한 형태입니다.  
`channel` 기준으로 provider를 선택합니다.

---

## 6. 서비스 레이어

### `src/services/notification.service.ts`

```ts
import { ProviderRouter } from '../providers/provider-router';
import { NotificationRequest, NotificationResult } from '../types/notification';

export class NotificationService {
  constructor(private readonly providerRouter: ProviderRouter) {}

  async sendNotification(request: NotificationRequest): Promise<NotificationResult> {
    return this.providerRouter.route(request);
  }
}
```

서비스는 provider 구현체를 직접 몰라도 되고, router만 알면 됩니다.

---

## 7. 실행 코드

### `src/index.ts`

```ts
import { EmailProvider } from './providers/email.provider';
import { SmsProvider } from './providers/sms.provider';
import { PushProvider } from './providers/push.provider';
import { ProviderRouter } from './providers/provider-router';
import { NotificationService } from './services/notification.service';

async function main() {
  const providers = [
    new EmailProvider(),
    new SmsProvider(),
    new PushProvider(),
  ];

  const router = new ProviderRouter(providers);
  const notificationService = new NotificationService(router);

  const requests = [
    {
      channel: 'email' as const,
      to: 'user@example.com',
      subject: 'Welcome',
      message: 'Hello by email',
    },
    {
      channel: 'sms' as const,
      to: '01012345678',
      message: 'Hello by sms',
    },
    {
      channel: 'push' as const,
      to: 'device-token-123',
      message: 'Hello by push',
    },
  ];

  for (const request of requests) {
    const result = await notificationService.sendNotification(request);
    console.log(result);
  }
}

main().catch((err) => {
  console.error(err);
  process.exit(1);
});
```

